  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad2e6255ccadc13b52a/step-b3266200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice capsicum. Trim and roughly chop green beans.\n• Cut firm tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the plain flour and salt. Add tofu and toss to coat.\n• In a small bowl, combine hoisin sauce, the soy sauce, and water (for the sauce).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad2e6255ccadc13b52a/step-90c1c310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook capsicum and green beans, tossing, until tender, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium then add remaining garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1 min. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, shake off excess flour and cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat then add hoisin sauce mixture and cooked veggies, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad2e6255ccadc13b52a/step-39e58b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with tofu and veggies. Drizzle with the mayonnaise to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648ad2e6255ccadc13b52a/step-2f8f9930.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
